| Next       | `func(fiber.Ctx) bool` | Skip when function returns true.          | nil                    |
| Rules      | `map[string]string`   | Map paths to new ones; `$1`, `$2` insert params. | Required               |
| StatusCode | `int`                 | HTTP code for redirects.                  | 302 Temporary Redirect |

