## Catching Errors

Return errors from route handlers and middleware so Fiber can handle them centrally.

<Tabs>
<TabItem value="example" label="Example">

```go
app.Get("/", func(c fiber.Ctx) error {
    // Pass error to Fiber
    return c.SendFile("file-does-not-exist")
})
```

</TabItem>
